    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it sounds like a system that's basically designed to protect the interests of the big powers while leaving everyone else to deal with the fallout. wouldn't you say that makes the whole thing pretty much obsolete for smaller countries trying to actually defend their own sovereignty?",
